R-TF8 R-TF2 R-B6 (slice 232, Design Q607): an entry with an unknown source kind stays as it was when tln writes `tools.json`. The home is a part of `tool/tm1-manage`: `foo` (the entry in the bin dir and the file in the data bin dir are the same, so `remove` deletes both) and `zed` (the kind `zzz`, with a field and a member that tln does not know). Run: `tool remove foo` works as tm1-manage run 7 (exit 0), and `tools.json` after it has only `zed`, with the same text.
